{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bThe demo version is limited to the\u300c\u00a0 Kingdom of Alicia \u300dallowing players to experience the prologue and early story. The full release will feature additional regions, character events, and expanded story content.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Game Overview\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced RPG. The protagonist, Julie, has had her soul transformed into a Futanari monster by the demon goddess Lia. To thwart the plans of the goddess Liss\u2014and to satisfy her own desires\u2014Julie sets off on an adventure in a world filled with many beautiful and charming women!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964870/extras/340196dc5a0248dc34eb91e30a40312a.avif?t=1760374091\" data-has-big width=1560 height=836 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Gameplay\u3011</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Devouring</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aside from essential story battles and elite enemies, players don\u2019t need to engage in traditional combat. Weaker monsters are instantly devoured upon collision, allowing Julie to grow stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964870/extras/5cbf9bf4651b59298878f2b6a6d6e694.poster.avif?t=1760374091\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964870/extras/5cbf9bf4651b59298878f2b6a6d6e694.webm?t=1760374091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964870/extras/5cbf9bf4651b59298878f2b6a6d6e694.mp4?t=1760374091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elite Enemies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating tough enemies rewards special items that make it even easier for Julie to dominate the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964870/extras/8a319c0a84aa10478711784e0a5eaf32.poster.avif?t=1760374091\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964870/extras/8a319c0a84aa10478711784e0a5eaf32.webm?t=1760374091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964870/extras/8a319c0a84aa10478711784e0a5eaf32.mp4?t=1760374091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection System</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A convenient CG collection guide feature lets you view the location of each undiscovered CG, and successfully collecting them can even boost your stats or level up your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964870/extras/2d667458d16c3835f1ccd0f287b61659.avif?t=1760374091\" data-has-big width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Female Characters</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No journey to becoming a mighty Demon Lord would be complete without encountering women of all personalities including monster girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps